(NAIROBI CITY COUNTY GOVERNMENT) Tj T*
(VACANCIES) Tj T*
(The Nairobi City County Government invites applications from qualified persons for the) Tj T*
(following positions in the county public service.) Tj T*
(1. ASSISTANT WARD ADMINISTRATOR - JOB GROUP H) Tj T*
(Number of Posts: Two \(2\)) Tj T*
(Salary: KSh. 42,000 - 55,000 per month) Tj T*
(Requirements for Appointment) Tj T*
(For appointment to this grade, a candidate must have:) Tj T*
(\(i\) a Diploma in Public Administration or an equivalent qualification;) Tj T*
(\(ii\) a minimum of two \(2\) years of experience in county administration;) Tj T*
(\(iii\) proficiency in office software.) Tj T*
(Duties and Responsibilities) Tj T*
(Coordination of ward-level service delivery and maintenance of county records.) Tj T*
(2. DRIVER - JOB GROUP E) Tj T*
(Number of Posts: Four \(4\)) Tj T*
(Salary: KSh. 28,000 - 34,000 per month) Tj T*
(Requirements for Appointment) Tj T*
(For appointment to this grade, a candidate must have:) Tj T*
(\(i\) a valid class BCE driving licence;) Tj T*
(\(ii\) no prior work experience is required; fresh graduates are encouraged to apply.) Tj T*
(Duties and Responsibilities) Tj T*
(Driving county vehicles and maintaining the vehicle log book.) Tj T*
(Applications should be submitted to the County Public Service Board.) Tj T*
(The closing date for all applications is 28th November 2026.) Tj T*
ET
